  <description>EFT X6100 hexacopter frame (AAVC 2026): 1.000 m wheelbase (0.500 m arm radius), 7.17 kg AUW, 6 rotors laid out to match the real Pixhawk 6X CA_ROTOR table for airframe 6001, IMU/baro/mag/GNSS, and a downward TFmini-S-class rangefinder. Frame only — see eft_x6100 for the flyable model.</description>
